    "summary": "A warm, all-American story about Max, who takes on the big-kid potty for the very first time — one brave step at a time.",
    "pages": [
      {
        "text": "Max wiggled and did a little dance.\n\"Uh-oh, I've got the potty wiggles!\"\nBut Max really didn't want to stop building his block tower.",
        "legacyImage": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061456_3e473c5a-1b69-4a5a-9e1a-f2f5ae1a27a3.png",
        "legacyAudio": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061553_c2df27d6-ffb1-4d04-95fe-3b96f8dac96b.mp3",
        "image": "/legacy/max-potty/p1.png"
      },
      {
        "text": "Then Daddy brought out the brand-new potty.\n\"Hey buddy, want to give the big-kid potty a try today?\"\nThe little blue potty looked friendly with its happy smiley sticker.",
        "legacyImage": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061500_9c6e6930-1ede-40f2-95a7-01326f70f2af.png",
        "legacyAudio": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061613_d769f4e3-ba38-46d3-b302-6cbfdeec8d0a.mp3",
        "image": "/legacy/max-potty/p2.png"
      },
      {
        "text": "\"But what if I miss?\"\nMax felt unsure. Daddy gave a warm smile.\n\"That's okay, champ. Everybody learns one step at a time. I'm right here.\"",
        "legacyImage": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061502_7039340d-3d75-4d3b-b1c8-1f2bbd75c25d.png",
        "legacyAudio": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061557_980d2947-b10f-41c5-8724-df9a8db9fa8f.mp3",
        "image": "/legacy/max-potty/p3.png"
      },
      {
        "text": "Max took a deep breath and climbed up.\nHe held on tight and gave a big push— hnngh.\n\"You've got this, Max!\"",
        "legacyImage": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061504_4b899850-dc87-449a-8ee0-9bcb605d72e6.png",
        "legacyAudio": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061600_b914aa60-cf63-40db-935f-c9eb778059d2.mp3",
        "image": "/legacy/max-potty/p4.png"
      },
      {
        "text": "And then... plop!\n\"Whoa! I did it!\"\nMax's eyes popped wide open. He really went in the potty all by himself!",
        "legacyImage": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061523_06ce8aee-ad71-4042-8730-20c83b68f0c0.png",
        "legacyAudio": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061633_bef31b1d-6efe-4b47-a11e-9c9d0b222e13.mp3",
        "image": "/legacy/max-potty/p5.png"
      },
      {
        "text": "\"Bye-bye!\"\nMax waved as he flushed. Whoooosh!\nThe water swirled round and round, just like a tiny water slide.",
        "legacyImage": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061525_4059627e-4d48-409f-bad6-30adb5968472.png",
        "legacyAudio": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061635_4fb4ff36-58c5-4725-9dd4-e6feec34b589.mp3",
        "image": "/legacy/max-potty/p6.png"
      },
      {
        "text": "\"High five, big guy!\"\nDaddy scooped Max up into a giant hug.\nA shiny gold star went right onto the potty chart. Max felt ten feet tall.",
        "legacyImage": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061529_beb87c2b-23aa-4cbb-8c32-a589e4786f0e.png",
        "legacyAudio": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061637_47e773b4-05c8-410f-a0f8-2dd348e6f7e6.mp3",
        "image": "/legacy/max-potty/p7.png"
      },
      {
        "text": "Now Max runs to the potty all by himself.\n\"I'm a big kid now!\"\nAnd every day, Max grows a little braver and a whole lot prouder.",
        "legacyImage": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061531_e9095fc1-98e8-4b22-9fa6-1f3ea9cfb214.png",
        "legacyAudio": "https://d8j0ntlcm91z4.cloudfront.net/user_3DFVCyIbK0iPipe7zhgZpfXD3Xc/hf_20260703_061640_5e0cb617-66b5-426b-b258-cafbbfdda055.mp3",
        "image": "/legacy/max-potty/p8.png"
      }
